.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
gpg(1), gpgv(1), pgp(1).
.PP
<https://ftp.isc.org/pub/pgpcontrol> is where the most recent versions of
\&\fBsigncontrol\fR and \fBpgpverify\fR live, along with PGP public keys used for
hierarchy administration.
